ral sulcus is a large sulcus that separates the frontal and parietal lobes (as well as the precentral gyrus and postcentral gyrus).')\">What is the Central Sulcus?</button>", "DefaultChoices": false, "DataExportTag": "Q240", "QuestionID": "QID240", "QuestionType": "DB", "Selector": "TB", "DataVisibility": {"Private": false, "Hidden": false}, "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "QuestionDescription": "Your Answer:\u00a0${q://QID51/ChoiceTextEntryValue} Correct Answer: Central Sulcus\u00a0 \u00a0 What is the Cent...", "ChoiceOrder": [], "Validation": {"Settings": {"Type": "None"}}, "GradingData": [], "Language": [], "NextChoiceId": 4, "NextAnswerId": 1, "DisplayLogic": {"0": {"0": {"LogicType": "EmbeddedField", "LeftOperand": "inc_dorsal_central_sulcus", "Operator": "NotEqualTo", "RightOperand": "0", "Type": "Expression", "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">inc_dorsal_central_sulcus</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\">0</span>"}, "Type": "If"}, "Type": "BooleanExpression", "inPage": false}}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_e5qxdjKxDQL1V8q", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID242", "SecondaryAttribute": "Dorsal 2", "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "Dorsal   2", "DefaultChoices": false, "QuestionType": "DB", "Selector": "GRB", "SubSelector": "WOTXB", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "QuestionDescription": "Dorsal 2", "ChoiceOrder": [], "Validation": {"Settings": {"Type": "None"}}, "GradingData": [], "Language": [], "NextChoiceId": 4, "NextAnswerId": 1, "Graphics": "IM_daK9tAyeRP9uZ25", "GraphicsDescription": "Dorsal   2", "DataVisibility": {"Private": false, "Hidden": false}, "QuestionText_Unsafe": "Dorsal   2", "DataExportTag": "Q242", "QuestionID": "QID242", "DisplayLogic": {"0": {"0": {"LogicType": "EmbeddedField", "LeftOperand": "inc_dorsal_precentral_gyrus", "Operator": "NotEqualTo", "RightOperand": "0", "Type": "Expression", "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">inc_dorsal_precentral_gyrus</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\">0</span>"}, "Type": "If"}, "Type": "BooleanExpression", "inPage": false}}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_e5qxdjKxDQL1V8q", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID243", "SecondaryAttribute": "Your Answer:\u00a0${q://QID54/ChoiceTextEntryValue} Correct Answer: Precentral Gyrus OR Primary Motor...", "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<strong>Your Answer:</strong>&nbsp;${q://QID54/ChoiceTextEntryValue}\n<div><strong>Correct Answer: </strong>Precentral Gyrus OR Primary Motor Cortex\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n\n<button onclick=\"alert('The precentral gyrus (also known as the primary motor cortex) is located just anterior to the central sulcus. This area initiates voluntary movement, especially complex distal movements. Axons from the precentral gyrus descend through the brain, traveling through the cerebral peduncles and pyramidal tracts, and ultimately terminate in the spinal cord.')\">What is the Precentral Gyrus?</button>", "DefaultChoices": false, "DataExportTag": "Q243", "QuestionID": "QID243", "QuestionType": "DB", "Selector": "TB", "DataVisibility": {"Private": false, "Hidden": false}, "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "QuestionDescription": "Your Answer:\u00a0${q://QID54/ChoiceTextEntryValue} Correct Answer: Precentral Gyrus OR Primary Motor...", "ChoiceOrder": [], "Validation": {"Settings": {"Type": "None"}}, "GradingData": [], "Language": [], "NextChoiceId": 4, "NextAnswerId": 1, "DisplayLogic": {"0": {"0": {"LogicType": "EmbeddedField", "LeftOperand": "inc_dorsal_precentral_gyrus", "Operator": "NotEqualTo", "RightOperand": "0", "Type": "Expression", "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">inc_dorsal_precentral_gyrus</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"